### 1. Metadados do serviço
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/info
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Accept: application/json

### 2. Passageira com perfil A
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Pclass": 1,
  "Sex": "female",
  "Age": 25,
  "SibSp": 0,
  "Parch": 0,
  "Fare": 80,
  "Embarked": "S"
}

### 3. Passageiro com perfil B
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Pclass": 3,
  "Sex": "male",
  "Age": 40,
  "SibSp": 1,
  "Parch": 0,
  "Fare": 7.25,
  "Embarked": "S"
}

### 4. Requisição inválida: idade deve ser numérica
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Pclass": 3,
  "Sex": "male",
  "Age": "idade inválida",
  "SibSp": 1,
  "Parch": 0,
  "Fare": 7.25,
  "Embarked": "S"
}
